{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>\n\n<img src=\"https://n.sinaimg.cn/finance/transform/662/w550h912/20261120/c768-2bc913c850934128cf465d9d2e787866.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>針對此事，截至發稿前，零跑汽車官方暫無回應。零跑汽車客服表示，事件還需要一些時間核實，有核實結果後會留言回復。客服還表示，零跑A10下沉式後備箱儲物盒最大承重在40kg左右。</p>\n<p>資料顯示，零跑A10是零跑汽車旗下一款純電小型SUV車型，於2026年3月上市 ，定位「智能精品長續航SUV」，代言人為陳都靈。上市指導價6.58-8.68萬元。</p>\n<p>新浪科技在零跑汽車App上看到，在零跑A10的用户手冊中也提到，後備箱儲物盒位於後備箱板下方，最大承重為40kg， 切勿超重使用。</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://n.sinaimg.cn/finance/transform/391/w550h641/20261120/4c1a-b00090bcffa16e6813fc74662c111b29.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://n.sinaimg.cn/finance/transform/662/w550h912/20261120/c768-2bc913c850934128cf465d9d2e787866.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T05:03:54.496720+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":235,"images":3,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T04:55:43+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T06:37:19.412237+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T04:57:25.875776+00:00","content_hash":"59c7147f2a5c54b20affcb4540150b11a54cb88c5b76f805dae257bd563a4f4e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}